    "body": "Comfy ver: 0.38.0 Rev 6042 [6b747c04]\nFront: 1.53.6 and up to 1.54.8\nPy: 3.12.10\nTorch: 2.14.1+cu130\n\nOne of the most important features, creating ribbons, just doesn't work properly. And I noticed that it is very easy to break connector positions using Ctrl+Z, which ends up causing visual glitches even with standard connections. Doesn't matter if it's Nodes 2.0 or legacy.\n\n<img width=\"800\" height=\"708\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ada7dc11-52b4-429e-be1f-a49e84ff9ce5\" />",
